WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:13.390
Aoi...

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.490
What is going on
with our school?

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.410
Is this really our school?

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.410
Our club room.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.950
The store.

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.250
And the school lunches!

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.500
Caviar lunch special?

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.170
That's a super expensive
gourmet ingredient.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:13.510
And they're still
selling it for 380 yen!

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.840
Does a new Chairperson
bring so much change?

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.430
Viva, Aiba Academy!

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.600
Everyone is happy
with the changes.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.310
For now, it appears the academy
reformation is complete.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:30.310
Yes. But our goal is
to defeat the Dark Stones.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.330
What is it?
They called me here...

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.260
Is this her family?

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:03.850
Is this...

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.310
When it happened?

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.230
Hey!

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.480
I think you went a
little overboard, oni.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.570
Oni.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.820
What is this?

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.820
What's up with you?
Why are you staring at me, oni?

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:23.950
You talk.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.950
Thanks for waiting, Alma.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.620
Hey, what is this?

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.380
What's going on,
Oni-gawara?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.590
Nothing, oni.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.920
He keeps staring at me,
so I'm glaring to get back at him, oni.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.260
Wait a minute,
this thing is alive?

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:44.760
It's the same type of Dark Stone as
the Medusa we encountered the other day.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:45.930
Dark Stone?

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:51.310
Don't worry. Oni-gawara isn't strong enough
to place you under his influence.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.070
For being such a big guy
he's got small nerves, oni.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.070
You'd be better as rubble.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.070
Shut up, oni!

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:01.700
You'd better shut your pie hole before
I crush your back molars, oni!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.450
Oni-gawara!
Show some self-control.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.540
That is also a power
of the Sacred Seven.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:15.420
What?

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.960
Sacred Seven?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.970
The power that lies
within you, Alma.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.090
Power?

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:27.350
Seventeen years ago,
meteorites fell across the world.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.560
Within those meteorites they found
minerals not of this earth.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:35.560
Those stones consist of seven different
substances and have a special power.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.940
We call those stones Sacred Seven.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:43.450
Sacred Seven has elements
that morph human DNA.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.370
There are reports that it can
mutate the human body.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.120
Tandoji.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.080
You have a very
special power.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:05:01.010
That is to say, there's a high probability that
your mother touched a Sacred Seven.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.970
Your mother, too?

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:04.510
Probably.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:05.470
What about...

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.140
this thing?

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.350
I don't have a mother, oni.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:12.350
I was hit by a falling
Sacred Seven long ago, oni.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.600
I'm eight hundred years old.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:18.610
I was a gargoyle
on the Buddha Hall in Kamakura, oni.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:25.070
As far as I know, Yoshitsune also touched the
stone. That's why he had special powers, oni.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:29.870
The power of the Sacred Seven differs,
depending on the one it has contact with.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.580
Those who activate the power,
we call Dark Stone.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.790
And those who control
it are called Soul Stone.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:40.630
Come to think of it, you were
raging just like Medusa, oni.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.050
So you're telling me that
the Dark Stones are a nuisance.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.760
Alma, you aren't like that.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.560
As long as I'm always by
your side, it'll be alright.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.140
Always with me?

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:58.980
Alma, there's a high probability that
the Dark Stones will appear more frequently.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.070
I want you to lend
us your power.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.900
Why don't you leave it to the police
or the Self-Defense For--?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.910
Organizations like that can't
handle what's to come.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.830
Alma, it has to be you.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:16.000
If you cooperate with us,
I'll do anything, spare no expense.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.210
We'll help with all
aspects of your life--

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.090
I'm sorry.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.710
Alma.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.670
Let me think about it.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.180
I have one thing
I need to ask.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.140
Yes?

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:30.930
That pendant in the picture.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.760
You wore it the
other day, didn't you?

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.730
That was...

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:43.980
She used that stone
to save you.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:44.940
Kagami.

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:47.530
I see.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.620
I guess I've been
a bit impatient.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:59.000
Miss Ruri, how about having
him meet Miss Aoi?

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.250
No, we can't do that.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.710
I don't want him to pity us.

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:19.270
<i>She used that stone to save you.</i>

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.810
To save me...

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.980
I was...

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.160
But...

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.070
What a burden.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.390
What's wrong?

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.390
I thought I saw someone.

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.350
Are you sure?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:07.190
No, probably just my imagination.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.230
Our club activities are really
low-key, aren't they?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:27.270
Oh, my back.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.610
Hey where's Kagami?

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.110
They've really been busy.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:36.110
Bummer. Just when I thought
our morale was on the rise.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:41.750
Hey! You're pretty
good looking.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:48.750
Oh, what a waste. You can't just
throw away stones that you pick up.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.800
I'm not looking for stones...

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.440
Do you remember?

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:17.950
This is where we first met.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.410
Hi there!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.120
Are you interested
in stones too?

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:31.420
I just moved here yesterday.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:36.010
I didn't think I'd get to know someone
who had the same interest as I did.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:38.760
See.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.760
This person here...

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:44.350
has memories of a
very long voyage.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:49.810
Our lives are but a fraction of what
this has experienced, don't you think?

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:54.820
Any one of these small stones, has
much more experience than us.

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:56.490
Stones.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:01.200
Yes, the smaller the stone the
more it's been through.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.500
It becomes smaller by rubbing against
others and withstanding the pressure.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:07.410
See.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.420
I'll give you this.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:14.960
I get it.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.130
I should be like a stone.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:21.970
Whoa.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.060
Hey.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:39.110
Due to the sand storm, we're beginning to see
the schedules of planes and trains affected.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.070
Yellow sands?

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:43.070
We have no reports
of Yellow sands.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:48.290
If it is Yellow sand, it should come from the continent,
but currently we're seeing southeastern winds.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.040
You mean from the Pacific?

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.750
Why is there static?

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:55.130
The cause is unknown.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.210
It appears there's static from the
weather satellites data itself.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.220
Something isn't right.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.340
How are the clouds?

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.090
<i>The speed has not changed.</i>

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:44.010
<i>But it's increasing in power at a pace that's impossible in nature.</i>

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.140
It must be a Dark Stone.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:47.470
Any effect on aviation?

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:50.390
<i>Not at this moment. We do not see any adverse effects.</i>

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:51.480
Copy that.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:57.440
Mr. Kagami, we're almost reached
the designated airspace.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:00.230
The sensors aren't
registering anything.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.160
I can't receive incoming messages.
There's too much interference.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:05.240
Dark Stone?

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.070
Yes.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.030
There's a high probability.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.210
What is in this
sea of clouds?

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:17.130
What is that light?

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.010
Dark Stone.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.930
Miss Ruri.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.180
I apologize for disturbing your meal.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:35.020
We've located a Dark Stone.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.020
Please take a look at this.

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.440
This is the Dark Stone?

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.570
Currently 800 km
south-southeast of Japan.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.070
Why is it in the air?

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:53.040
The other day, a US military freight plane
disappeared above the Pacific Ocean.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.330
There's a bigger problem.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.460
The Dark Stone looks
like a dragon.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.590
It consists of some powerful
explosive material.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.220
The US military is trying to hide it.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:09.550
But the missing plane was
transporting nitrogen chloride corbite.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.060
And the Dark Stone possessed it.

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:13.470
We believe so.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:17.730
This sea of clouds is moving
closer to Japan.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.980
If that hits Japan...

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.990
Have you made
your decision?

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.410
I have someone I'd
like you to meet.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.240
You're not driving without
a license, are you?

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.410
I'm 18. I have a license.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.080
Repeated some grades?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:40.540
For your information, I skipped ahead
and have graduated from Harvard.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:43.250
The only reason I'm at the
school is to be with you.

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.260
So why do you guys
keep fighting?

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:49.510
Once you meet her
you'll understand.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:54.430
Get in.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.440
What is this yard?

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.740
This entrance, it's way
bigger than my house.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.030
This way.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.670
Who is this person you
want me to meet?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.460
She's right here.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.430
She's alive!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.680
You can feel that?

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.810
This young lady is the only living
kin of our Miss Ruri.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.730
Her elder sister, Miss Aoi.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.230
What happened?

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:49.490
The day this picture was taken,
she became a stone.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:53.240
And unfortunately, our miss' parents
were killed by the Dark Stones.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.160
She also has a pendant.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.330
It was a present
from the madam.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:15:59.830
A memento...

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:06.300
Our Miss Ruri created the organization,
with her family's inheritance, to combat the Dark Stones.

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:11.510
If she keeps fighting the Dark Stones, she believes one
day she'll return her sister to her former self.

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.180
Even using her memento.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:21.520
To tell you the truth, I don't
want to use your powers.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.650
But only you can
defeat the Dark Stones.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.690
Kagami!

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:33.570
Miss Ruri.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.620
Why did you bring Alma
here to meet Aoi?

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.660
I apologize.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:42.370
You shouldn't pressure him into doing
this by exposing our situation.

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:43.710
Will I make a difference?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.880
Will I really make a difference?

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.260
Alma...

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.630
Let's do this.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:00.890
Wait a minute.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:04.810
I said I'd help, but why are we
skydiving all of a sudden?

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:08.570
It can't be helped.
This Dark Stone is in the clouds.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:12.780
I didn't sign up for this. I've never
gone skydiving before in my life.

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:15.910
No need to worry.
Everyone has a first time.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.330
Are you kidding me?

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.330
I can't.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:19.790
I can't do this!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:23.540
I knew it, he's got
small nerves, oni.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.580
There's no time for discussion.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:28.920
The Dark Stone is hovering right
above the Ogasawara depth.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.590
Our only option is to sink it
deep into the sea.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.920
Can't help you.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:36.800
A Dark Stone in the clouds.
How do you fight such a thing?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:37.930
Hey Alma!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:41.270
It's me, use me, oni.

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.520
Take me with you and
go inside it, oni.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.940
That way I can tell you
its big vital spot, oni.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:48.690
Oni!

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.940
<i>We are under attack by the Dark Stone. Return to your seats immediately.</i>

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.580
Dark Stone spotted at 11 o'clock.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.330
Whoa!

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.670
Oni!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.340
Whoa!

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.590
Alma!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.800
Oni!

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:19.970
Miss Ruri.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:21.560
Your parachute!

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.770
If I don't go now
it'll be too late.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.810
Nooooo!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.560
Oni!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.990
This is not happening!

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.780
That's...

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.750
Hey, why don't you
have a parachute?

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.960
I don't need one!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.670
What? Yes you do!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.880
I believe in you, Alma.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.630
That's beside the point!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.220
What you need right now is a parachute--

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:03.760
What?

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.890
I'll always be by
your side, Alma.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.940
Your memories
I take into me.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:17.700
My Soul...

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.530
I give to you!

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:26.870
For now...

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.790
...stick with me.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.880
The power to freely
move about the sky!

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:53.400
I've found the vital point, oni.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.820
So this is a Dark Stone.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.790
Dang it.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:10.750
Where is its vital spot?

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.880
It's so big I can't find it.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:15.090
Whoa!

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:27.560
Alma! Look, it's Oni-gawara!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:31.100
My full power, oni.

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:37.730
I can tell you its big
vital point, oni.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.450
Hold on tight!
We're going straight in!

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:42.070
OK.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.580
If I'm with her, my power...

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.420
Thank you, Alma!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:42.050
Um, Alma. You can
let me down now.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:45.760
I'd like to, but I can't
do that right now.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:50.680
Y-You do have a point.

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:03.860
Miss Ruri.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:06.610
Please do not do such
a thing ever again.

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:09.830
If Tandoji's powers did not...

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:13.580
Alma will always protect me.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.080
Always.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.890
Um, what about
Oni-gawara?

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:33.720
Oh.

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:44.860
Hey!
Someone come help me, oni!
